<title>Ethiopia: the situation</title>
<link>https://map.igred.org/crisis/ethiopia/</link>
<guid isPermaLink="false">igred-summary-ethiopia-2026-10-28T18:58:20.319Z</guid>
<pubDate>Wed, 28 Oct 2026 18:58:20 GMT</pubDate>
<description>&lt;p&gt;Armed attackers killed at least 60 Orthodox Christians in two separate incidents in Oromia, while a drone strike in western Oromia killed two government civil servants. Senior Tigray Military Commander Major General Yohannes was captured near the Eritrean border. Ethiopia received delivery of 12 Russian Su-35 fighter jets, with plans for S-400 air defenses, amid rising tensions with Eritrea. Over 35,000 Ethiopians have fled across the Kenya border, and up to 50,000 are reported to have fled into Kenya's Moyale County. The conflict produced 2,824 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMijwFBVV95cUxQSl9RZXktMzNjWWNNLUtNT1AySlhCNTltZ1ktWENhQVFWaVd3aGdDMkRZVFgzZktHWHp3Z0RKcENRb3NueEs0UHZRcS1yTmVlZTRrNndOSEhTRHBEVGJnQmc5WS1zMnQ5Ymx0VVRGNVpnR25oWG5UaVR6MTA1WXVoZXlQNEQ0WWdOeHB6eGhBSQ?oc=5&quot;&gt;France 24&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Al Jazeera&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiXkFVX3lxTE92bm0xcTFfYzhLRmRCUWRZY1hmWUdhOUctX1JVVzFMelFDcUhhZ3NPVDZfcDk3dXR6Q3NuTlh2SmZlR0I4SWYwTzd3eG4wNlBVTVpldVNwb2ZVcmdiYWc?oc=5&quot;&gt;BBC&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiiAFBVV95cUxPUEl5MzlpUlgxbFJDanVVY1phZFg0dFAxVnAzNVhsb1VwM1UzMFlmd1FyUTRmdGU5MHdYeEJqcFNmZk9EbzNuZjNGZzBEcldaRjR2aWpSaEx4TWpUWUx0RVkyRTYzcmpHX1hVblpETV9Jb1YzRS1PUlBOTE5ydGFnNTEtb3JuTXRo?oc=5&quot;&gt;Daily Beirut&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMivAFBVV95cUxNS3dCTGFmMjVISkdyY3RLOW9ZMllwR0pia29mYW1XWUpJaEQtc0FfS01qNFBPSzdHSnZVMGhKaWt3SW1GMTkwWm5abG5XNFhpWDdtYnZucFQ1LVltZklZN0lydml3UXF4ODFxMUxmeDdVNHJ6R0ZEUzFJaTdnZGVCekNWVmJ3YWRnWkhpaUlBVU9CUXVUUnhqMjJfVExmMUZkb3I1Sms4aERtNVd3QkRVbEMtcVREanJ0WTd6bw?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Eastleigh Voice&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;ht